      ogDescription="Web 3 Fintech is inevitable. The only question: how will it be powered? Radix is the only Layer-1 protocol intentionally designed to meet the needs of billions of users and trillions worth of assets."
      ogImage="https://www.radixdlt.com/assets/625d983475936822459f8f9e_Brave-Opengraphic.png"
      twitterTitle="Discover-ebook"
      twitterDescription="Web 3 Fintech is inevitable. The only question: how will it be powered? Radix is the only Layer-1 protocol intentionally designed to meet the needs of billions of users and trillions worth of assets."
      twitterImage="https://www.radixdlt.com/assets/625d983475936822459f8f9e_Brave-Opengraphic.png"
      ogType
      twitterCard
      canonical="https://www.radixdlt.com/lp/brave/discover-report"
      tail={headTail}
    />
  </head>
  <body>
  <BraveLandingBody
    currentPath={currentPath}
